  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a0bf2662a24262475d803606",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "即将展现在众人面前。",
      "source_fingerprint": "173a619161c65c949190c95e91a3cdb2c8b14fa83a96f9322076cd2315f73f75",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "202",
        "10204"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3b4d45a989bb1a86f8cf0a1d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "虽然还尚未获胜，但至今跑出的精彩竞赛已经让观众为之倾倒。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d0e727b72fc147ed35a2ad5abcaa2d301f5903b058900cf10a2b80276a48a02",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "202",
        "1100"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8184230c5657dc81afecd675",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "受到瞩目的训练员<color=#ff9900>「<username>」</color>。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3737cd239952f126e445632afbbcebd0ccc63e57b6b7d8ea704875e4aacafadb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "202",
        "11000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b75cf0875cfe79f4e679508d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "头号冠军候补的<color=#ff9900>「<username>」</color>。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dfd9440ecbe4709e04537b14b6c708115affcee570e65ebc7adaf852d02b61cc",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "202",
        "110000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:557eb8f885e972f6372b1660",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "本次大赛的功臣<color=#ff9900>「<username>」</color>。",
      "source_fingerprint": "db32d3d9b516a5e81f2a92a93317e94078c75c7d846bfec18eb2f8234d23bb70",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "202",
        "110001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:65ac548de2bb18eacca1b92b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "关注想扳回一城的<color=#ff9900>「<username>」</color>。",
      "source_fingerprint": "247e267cf55bc1b320c1e14b8444ca2e920fb4934e885c18707a1e21a6a5c3cd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "202",
        "11001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b7a308907b0bac93301a15f3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "正报名参赛这次大赛的<color=#ff9900>「<username>」</color>。",
      "source_fingerprint": "941e4efbd16e385fcc6aae3054a0efae036394c28cb5fa7313bba5585030ebdb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "202",
        "11002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:25e89676d39f0e86bc587e76",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "虽然还尚未获胜，但看来已经习惯本次大赛的气氛了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e70af9b3e1a6e9d58683a7d518ac07e71ff2b847641b60f3073ba12e9d359a5c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "202",
        "1101"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:14c04b1a1c31a61f4b7e6958",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在预选赛中的总胜率为<total_win_percent>%，以压倒性的战绩攀升至此。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a347102d42d74a32267465c390f6b459619d0998778d32485c14d4ae68fe0b20",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "202",
        "110100"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ea321caef009beee41f4b4e2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "如彗星般闪现，以无人能及的实力席卷大赛，奔往决赛的路畅通无阻。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7393622294944ef6f91ddcdf8557530ed71cd1cad17a4439b7bd4e09313b2143",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "202",
        "110101"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:06a73e0ebccb3f4eab3b199e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "虽然还尚未获胜，但的确暗藏某种资质。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e2a37a43baecb2c3544a4e44f9263cd4260addc5351ec0fc12f1d658691addfb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "202",
        "1102"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f78655b4a5c8f92d4eba6c2b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "足以获胜的强悍，足以获胜的高速。决赛时也能见识到那股实力吗……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "728d0504eaf29d294d02b41213ff6585f2cb04af459370e1ace0a137f8bf90c2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "202",
        "110200"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e86741a9b5c80c19ef7cc5bf",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "有办法顺利获得优胜，实现有始有终的成果吗？绝对不要错过！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d69d6cff5304c04f175d8a8464040e652cbc936f8784845e2ff20d4fb8465063",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "202",
        "110201"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bade81e164483ec0415b6cad",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "总之希望这一战能够获胜，或许至今的努力方向不正确。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9bc32e3773facb0f8491341640a9885c69134b056a704c21fe110b7505631aa7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "202",
        "1103"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e30a69864991f55c087f3291",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "虽然有的竞赛没能掌握胜利，不过在获胜的竞赛中展现出的精彩表现已证明了实力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "378d325b5502360d1f72e8e5bc2682f6bf11cc43e66db525bfb8a80ffb60a090",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "202",
        "11100"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0a6dc3ee286e3810ceded98c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "至今5战仅得1胜的成绩虽不甚理想，但还是要朝下场胜利确实迈进。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ef0423fb17a00b49e1a232c9a0e9feedb8db030027e875d608dc6792aec1e043",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "202",
        "11101"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:68f86950f8c624e566b84c33",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最近5场竞赛的胜率为20%，虽不理想却是处于蓄势待发的状态。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2db7e0f0a8b9f9d8415b8e2356c238ec178683a6c4751d386038944cb30ba524",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "202",
        "11102"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6cd313bf9d5df9f2940d6189",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "有办法借着这场竞赛扶摇直上吗……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bdd357db8d6cfe34f5b16a0be39106e0b98685d199084f2421106bba1a05dfa9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "202",
        "11200"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7f44845632d5151de5c74c76",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "想要透过获胜改变情势！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1c0b20057f5fd1efb572c9d12b013e6561a1ac184f1f1992be373e24f2e23077",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "202",
        "11201"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7510c4a9830d5681b28bc715",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "感觉可以期待这场更加鼓起干劲的竞赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "107535337bc2cbe3004915bd7cc6fe993cd7615936d973e466f5577c7dd62f91",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "202",
        "11202"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:beca9bedf40b466c555f2900",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "就此期待<color=#ff9900>「<username>」</color>引领的赛马娘吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7a5220e000e9bd6407ddbd0859ef794bf22f2b98c542f2429567a0874e4bd758",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "202",
        "1200"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:69c0d70825174925e064eb17",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "受到瞩目的训练员<color=#ff9900>「<username>」</color>。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3737cd239952f126e445632afbbcebd0ccc63e57b6b7d8ea704875e4aacafadb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "202",
        "12000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:54e737174a07e5fc3c4d1854",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这次大赛备受瞩目的<color=#ff9900>「<username>」</color>。",
      "source_fingerprint": "693a75169fde66d9f8df215a391d2239e1938925c42ab210d6b71d85e85a56d1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "202",
        "12001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f5311329bc0b8e18d1a31de9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "本次受到瞩目的是<color=#ff9900>「<username>」</color>。",
      "source_fingerprint": "072b6849911ab67667475f9a50691395f3f0f92ea91beafea95a85632f52e45a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "202",
        "12002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:49ccde5fcecb1e3e0e50f1b2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "感觉会是场考验潜力的重要竞赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e33ad8965c590e7448865db7153f1dcbd473a4757953f61504d92c573cec8ebd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "202",
        "1201"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:994ea3d88edf774ff548032f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "虽然最近的战绩为5战2胜，但从实力来看，希望能挑战更高的目标。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3c9b26fbb28a5963bea505b19599ecff5d18f3ca4bb521aaab61f147cad933a8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "202",
        "12100"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:79b55e3727d6a90230f0796d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在最近的5战中获得了2胜，为了在决赛获得胜利，希望让状况变得更好。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5ef6eea9525bf3f34f15d17826a89608ecca8809485fdaea77f9a728a21f3029",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "202",
        "12101"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:71ffdf7a797a0b75bc5d0c2b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "至今5场竞赛的胜率是40%，虽然成绩不差但还有实力尚未发挥。",
      "source_fingerprint": "53f06b3dc52cd0bdfb3514286c5fcb20b4f5d22dfb2431189d89e9b4011aa364",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "202",
        "12102"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:56af4dbd6b6d1fd0f9ca7ac1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "面临这场不能输的挑战，期待<color=#ff9900>「<username>」</color>的表现！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0d0d9067848eb830e71366e2910ad5e29c97cf51fab756eac2a3b81bb949c6a5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "202",
        "12200"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a50da7ed21032d226b8acdb1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "期待拿出全力的<color=#ff9900>「<username>」</color>能带来出色的竞赛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6f21b5382d6d085fa74f5253293f9752c946d58517f066d51a9261f2b2ea8d7a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "202",
        "12201"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:520d0cbb18d1095979ee962c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "可以在这次竞赛竭尽全力，抵达更高之处吗……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b51473e753d499170541ca9816084c7df55a38ce3f4f920728b40fb79909adf8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "202",
        "12202"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:804f77d1bc6720c87bdf32ea",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "重点训练员<color=#ff9900>「<username>」</color>。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c4701ccdf32a1da7b3b57c6b52db6f6f00e676cececc202e08fb0242906c8ee5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "202",
        "13000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4e020720f13c30ec36b0be68",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这次大赛极度备受瞩目的<color=#ff9900>「<username>」</color>。",
      "source_fingerprint": "52e47abb06e30d257a726bbb58ecda3db9d27c7c1266012b6b9afdd0186d3ced",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "202",
        "13001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1d5782fb59d5f851564b2066",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "拿出亮眼成果的<color=#ff9900>「<username>」</color>。",
      "source_fingerprint": "05495177f0bd1f638db89bf049455baaae5417487007c3823633a0c3d2bee904",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "202",
        "13002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:77e932393b39049237e65fcb",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "可以在关键时刻展现实力，确实掌握胜利。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3e67b2235bcddd0e19140106f403f546f835dd24f01e2bd0ac41906ca1deb9a8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "202",
        "13100"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:953d372530d6cf4aeaf438c4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在最近的5战中获得3胜，从对手们皆处在甘拜下风的立场来看可说是充分发挥了实力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d70b562fa4af9cbeeb2928f8de16b1ef06cc6b9a5f2f408c7fe17c71e822f96b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "202",
        "13101"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8915a1f510a4ff41236c1da4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "兼具实力与运气，能在重要的竞赛获得胜利即是一流的证明。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8ac8edc3cebfd7e6692cc8f481fde59f7bfd233d52b97c5421d27c3e92a01fd6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "202",
        "13102"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c1c82bfa399f15f97e861da1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "即使在这场竞赛中，也能让全国粉丝为之着迷吗……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2cf76a5b39083585a664a58bb02af51bd61ee20058c28b0ace1f467c50513aaf",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "202",
        "13200"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:41372bc0ab7ae53d6751f323",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "有办法响应广大期待，在本次的一战中获胜吗……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9a6940864c18dab07fe355b62995495ae9b0b307064198e751693ce081a9d376",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "202",
        "13201"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cd866d62aa085d39ea136799",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "正被锁定的<color=#ff9900>「<username>」</color>也不容错过。",
      "source_fingerprint": "668ce09e1141fa58793c7cb7a58d874aad9e4547b4eef252325bd02a880dbc06",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "202",
        "13202"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2743bfc9dee9f9fe3081a98b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "成为本次大赛主角而扬名的<color=#ff9900>「<username>」</color>。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f2021af0dd9dfa6e882624a3b0ec57b6d48c0444191d9bca452147336554c013",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "202",
        "14000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f952f30260511c1434543c2f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这次大赛首屈一指的强者<color=#ff9900>「<username>」</color>。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a35a294639e30c4d277b1f0ed766e61dd06312d4b73d097d537ba4b7f9942be5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "202",
        "14001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:569e18853c5ecb720ef4c12e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "本次大赛的瞩目目标<color=#ff9900>「<username>」</color>。",
      "source_fingerprint": "da869d422a91fded0329e25e4dcb7a25a069063126fdb341d19357ce11c7f1c1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "202",
        "14002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bf90b539c9253e5550c7db1f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在最近的5战中获得4胜，留下了压倒性的好成绩，连想象其战败的模样都很困难。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0aa6332be22bd404b5050a10d57748a6fb7fd4e0e782a6b2070437024234b035",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "202",
        "14100"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:32f2f145a301d81cf92058e9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "至今5场竞赛的胜率是80%！这场竞赛理所当然地也被看好。",
